{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/Main_Capsule_-_2_-_2.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into an amazing world of <strong>fantasy</strong> and <strong>adventure</strong> with our <strong>game</strong> ! Test your <strong>memory</strong> and <strong>concentration</strong> as you explore a <strong>jungle</strong> full of <strong>cute</strong> and <strong>funny animals</strong> ... and a lot of <strong>secrets</strong> !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>casual</strong> and <strong>fun</strong> <strong>challenge</strong>, you'll need to find <strong>matching cards</strong> and connect the <strong>pairs</strong>. With its <strong>randomly generated levels</strong> and <strong>engaging gameplay</strong>, this <strong>game</strong> is the perfect way to unwind and sharpen your <strong>skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a fan of <strong>light-hearted fun</strong> or a <strong>thrilling</strong> mental <strong>test</strong>, this game can give you <strong>hours</strong> of <strong>amazing entertainment</strong>. Try it now and <strong>experience</strong> an awesome <strong>card-matching</strong> <strong>adventure</strong> in the wild !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/description-line-Pirate-Boar.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/gif-600.gif?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/description-line-Ice-Worm.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>~ LEGENDS SAY ~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Legends</strong> say ... in ancient times the spies trained their <strong>memory</strong> by watching a box with objects, then the box closes. Little by little they were able to point the position and the direction of enormous amount of objects !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After their <strong>special training</strong> they -\u00a0<strong>legends</strong> say - were capable to <strong>memorize</strong> whole page of important document after only seeing it for a few seconds !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/description-line-Fox.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOU CAN EASILY PLAY FOR HOURS AND HAVE A LOT OF FUN</strong><br><strong>WITH THIS NEW GAME ! </strong>     </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the new and amazing adventure in the depths of the jungle,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">where you can train your memory ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Complete more than 240 levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Each time the levels are randomly generated !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Collect unique cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unlock achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- and much more in this epic adventure !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can complete the levels in a <strong>timely manner</strong>, but YOU choose how to play. Will you <strong>challenge</strong> yourself and beat your previous <strong>record</strong>, or simply <strong>have fun</strong> and <strong>relaxing</strong> - it's <strong>up to you</strong> !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amaze yourself with your skills you never knew existed !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/description-line-Ivy-Tree.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>~ HOW TO PLAY ~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Pair the cards to remove them from the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remove all cards to finish the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are fast enought, you will mark a new highscore. Improve while having fun !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/baner-how-to-play.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the easiest difficulty - Easy difficulty - the cards must be paired only by their images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete the levels on all difficulties : easy, medium, hard, ultra hard !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then comes the ultimate challenge - the Almost impossible difficulty !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">COME AND SHOW YOUR SKILLS !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/description-line-Bat.jpg?t=1749068505\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>~ REVIEWS ~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/reviews-1.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/reviews-5.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/reviews-2.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/reviews-3.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/reviews-4.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/