ge - the Almost impossible difficulty !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">COME AND SHOW YOUR SKILLS !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/description-line-Bat.jpg?t=1749068505\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>~ REVIEWS ~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/reviews-1.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/reviews-5.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/reviews-2.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/reviews-3.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/reviews-4.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/Baner-The-Starving-Writer.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/Baner-Tricky-Bananna.jpg?t=1749068505\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Les Jeux de Milen"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/80533dfe82e373fb9c5f9b6b7c6dc36772b2f139/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1749068505","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_